      "content": "it's just... there's no point in trying to repair things that are meant to be broken. the house, my life, all of it. i keep thinking about how easy it would be to just stop being part of the noise. to just become part of the landscape, quiet and still, forever. do you think there's any shame in that? in choosing to just... go?",
